{"docKey":"0581_shortest_unsorted_continuous_subarray","code":"from typing import List\n\n\nclass Solution:\n    \"\"\"\n    最短无序连续子数组 - 双指针一次遍历\n\n    从左向右找右边界：维护最大值，当前值小于最大值则需要排序\n    从右向左找左边界：维护最小值，当前值大于最小值则需要排序\n\n    时间复杂度：O(n)\n    空间复杂度：O(1)\n    \"\"\"\n\n    def findUnsortedSubarray(self, nums: List[int]) -> int:\n        n = len(nums)\n        maxn, right = float(\"-inf\"), -1\n        minn, left = float(\"inf\"), -1\n\n        for i in range(n):\n            # 从左向右：找右边界\n            if maxn > nums[i]:\n                right = i\n            else:\n                maxn = nums[i]\n\n            # 从右向左：找左边界\n            if minn < nums[n - i - 1]:\n                left = n - i - 1\n            else:\n                minn = nums[n - i - 1]\n\n        return 0 if right == -1 else right - left + 1","method":"findUnsortedSubarray","paramNames":["nums"],"args":["[2,6,4,8,10,9,15]"],"expected":"5","result":5,"events":[{"line":16,"locals":{"nums":[2,6,4,8,10,9,15]},"depth":1},{"line":17,"locals":{"nums":[2,6,4,8,10,9,15],"n":7},"depth":1},{"line":18,"locals":{"nums":[2,6,4,8,10,9,15],"n":7,"maxn":null,"right":-1},"depth":1},{"line":20,"locals":{"nums":[2,6,4,8,10,9,15],"n":7,"maxn":null,"right":-1,"minn":null,"left":-1},"depth":1},{"line":22,"locals":{"nums":[2,6,4,8,10,9,15],"n":7,"maxn":null,"right":-1,"minn":null,"left":-1,"i":0},"depth":1},{"line":25,"locals":{"nums":[2,6,4,8,10,9,15],"n":7,"maxn":null,"right":-1,"minn":null,"left":-1,"i":0},"depth":1},{"line":28,"locals":{"nums":[2,6,4,8,10,9,15],"n":7,"maxn":2,"right":-1,"minn":null,"left":-1,"i":0},"depth":1},{"line":31,"locals":{"nums":[2,6,4,8,10,9,15],"n":7,"maxn":2,"right":-1,"minn":null,"left":-1,"i":0},"depth":1},{"line":20,"locals":{"nums":[2,6,4,8,10,9,15],"n":7,"maxn":2,"right":-1,"minn":15,"left":-1,"i":0},"depth":1},{"line":22,"locals":{"nums":[2,6,4,8,10,9,15],"n":7,"maxn":2,"right":-1,"minn":15,"left":-1,"i":1},"depth":1},{"line":25,"locals":{"nums":[2,6,4,8,10,9,15],"n":7,"maxn":2,"right":-1,"mi